===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*hugjaną|t=think, consider}}. Cognate with {{cog|got|𐌷𐌿𐌲𐌾𐌰𐌽}}, {{cog|non|huga}} ({{cog|is|hugsa|t=to think}}). Related to Middle Scots {{m|sco|huik|t=to regard, consider}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ang|/ˈhyd.d͡ʒɑn/}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb|head=hyċġan}}

# to [[think]]
# to think about, to [[consider]]

